### Reset endpoints
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/endpoints/delete HTTP/1.1

### Reset users
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/users/delete HTTP/1.1


### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpassword"
}


### Login user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpassword"
}


### List endpoints - unauthorized, should fail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints HTTP/1.1


### List endpoints - authenticated user, should return empty list first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Create endpoint: successful delivery target
POST http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "httpbin success test",
  "target_url": "https://httpbin.org/post",
  "description": "Successful delivery test"
}


### Create endpoint: failing delivery target
POST http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "httpbin failure test",
  "target_url": "https://httpbin.org/status/500",
  "description": "500 status code test"
}


### List endpoints - should now return authenticated user's endpoints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Get specific endpoint - authenticated user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/SUCCESS_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Get specific endpoint - invalid UUID format
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/1234 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Get specific endpoint - valid UUID but endpoint does not exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Send webhook - unauthorized, should fail
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/SUCCESS_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Event-Type: test.created

{
  "message": "unauthorized webhook test"
}


### Send webhook: successful delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/SUCCESS_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
X-Event-Type: test.created

{
  "message": "successful delivery test"
}


### Send webhook: failing delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/FAILURE_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
X-Event-Type: test.failed

{
  "message": "500 status code test"
}


### Send webhook: invalid UUID format
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/1234 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "message": "invalid UUID format"
}


### Send webhook: valid UUID but endpoint does not exist
POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "message": "valid UUID not in the DB"
}


### Send webhook with wrong method
GET http://localhost:8080/webhooks/SUCCESS_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Delete endpoint - authenticated owner
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/SUCCESS_ENDPOINT_ID HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Delete endpoint - invalid UUID format
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/1234 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Delete endpoint - valid UUID but endpoint does not exist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/endpoints/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### List events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events HTTP/1.1


### List deliveries
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries HTTP/1.1